  max_files: {max_files}
  max_new_modules: {max_new_modules}
---

<!-- allowed status: To Do | Ongoing | Done | Fail | Awaiting PO Approval -->
<!-- allowed complexity: simple | complex -->
<!-- set approval to "granted" to resume HIGH risk tickets -->

